      "evaluation_call": "然后他给我打电话。",
      "direct_call": "然后他给我打电话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "source": "Biz ertaga ertalab yo'lga chiqamiz.",
      "reference": "我们明天早上出发。",
      "evaluation_call": "我们早就走向延迟的路径",
      "direct_call": "我们早就走向延迟的路径"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "source": "Iltimos, derazani ochmang.",
      "reference": "请不要打开窗户。",
      "evaluation_call": "最后,请勿打开门",
      "direct_call": "最后,请勿打开门"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "source": "Shifoxona bank yonida joylashgan.",
      "reference": "医院在银行旁边。",
      "evaluation_call": "位于Shifoxona银行内。",
      "direct_call": "位于Shifoxona银行内。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "source": "Men kalitni uyda unutib qoldirdim.",
      "reference": "我把钥匙忘在家里了。",
      "evaluation_call": "我在床上忘记了品质",
      "direct_call": "我忘记了品质。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "source": "Agar yomg'ir yog'sa, biz bog'ga bormaymiz.",
      "reference": "如果下雨，我们就不去公园。",
      "evaluation_call": "若是子,我们就不是子",
      "direct_call": "若是子,我们就不是子"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "source": "Men Toshkentga chipta sotib olmoqchiman.",
      "reference": "我想买一张去塔什干的车票。",
      "evaluation_call": "我可以买个芯片。",
      "direct_call": "我可以买个芯片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "source": "Poyezd tushdan keyin soat 3 da yetib keladi.",
      "reference": "火车下午3点到达。",
      "evaluation_call": "火车停车后下午3点",
      "direct_call": "火车停车后下午3点"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "source": "Bu xonada issiq suv yo'q.",
      "reference": "这个房间没有热水。",
      "evaluation_call": "这里没有热水",
      "direct_call": "这里没有热水"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "source": "Iltimos, manzilni menga yuboring.",
      "reference": "请把地址发给我。",
      "evaluation_call": "最后,发送给我的信号",
      "direct_call": "最后,发送给我的信号"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "source": "Men allaqachon nonushta qildim.",
      "reference": "我已经吃过早饭了。",
      "evaluation_call": "我已经失败了",
      "direct_call": "我已经失败了"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "source": "U hali qaytib kelmadi.",
      "reference": "他还没有回来。",
      "evaluation_call": "他还没有回来。",
      "direct_call": "他还没有回来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "source": "Bu mening telefonim emas.",
      "reference": "这不是我的手机。",
      "evaluation_call": "不是我的电话",
      "direct_call": "不是我的电话"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "source": "Iltimos, sekinroq gapiring.",
      "reference": "请慢一点说。",
      "evaluation_call": "最后,比较轻松",
      "direct_call": "最后,比较轻松"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "source": "Men bu gapni tushunmayapman.",
      "reference": "我听不懂这句话。",
      "evaluation_call": "我不懂这个差距",
      "direct_call": "我不懂这个差距"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "source": "Biz o'n daqiqa kutishimiz kerak.",
      "reference": "我们需要等十分钟。",
      "evaluation_call": "我们需要一分钟的盒子",
      "direct_call": "我们需要一分钟的盒子"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "source": "Do'kon kechqurun soat sakkizda yopiladi.",
      "reference": "商店晚上八点关门。",
      "evaluation_call": "夜晚下午八点关闭",
      "direct_call": "夜晚下午八点关闭"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "source": "Iltimos, chapga buriling, keyin to'g'ri yuring.",
